\Topic{The $n$th~derivatives of $a/(a^{2} + x^{2})$ and $x/(a^{2} + x^{2})$.} Since
\[
\frac{a}{a^{2} + x^{2}}
  = \frac{1}{2i} \left(\frac{1}{x - ai} - \frac{1}{x + ai}\right), \quad
